#. Plugin Name of the plugin
#: post-branch.php
msgid "WP Branches For Post"
msgstr "WP Branches For Post"

#. Plugin URI of the plugin
#: post-branch.php
msgid "https://github.com/hsxk/WP-Branches-For-Post/"
msgstr "https://github.com/hsxk/WP-Branches-For-Post/"

#. Description of the plugin
#: post-branch.php
msgid ""
"Create safe working branches for published WordPress content and merge them "
"back without changing the public post while editing."
msgstr ""
"为已发布的 WordPress 内容创建安全的工作分支，在编辑期间保持公开文章不变，完成"
"后再将更改合并回原始文章。"

#. Author of the plugin
#: post-branch.php
msgid "Hao Kexin"
msgstr "Hao Kexin"

