#: includes/class-admin.php:297 build/index.js:7 src/index.js:849
msgid "The original post is unavailable. This branch cannot be merged."
msgstr "原始文章不可用，无法合并此分支。"

#: includes/class-admin.php:309 includes/class-admin.php:408
msgid ""
"The original changed after this branch was created. This action will force "
"the merge and prefer branch values where changes overlap. Continue only "
"after reviewing both versions."
msgstr ""
"创建此分支后原始文章已发生变化。此操作将强制合并，并在重叠更改处优先采用分支"
"值。请检查两个版本后再继续。"

#: includes/class-admin.php:321
