msgstr "更新分支失败，并且无法自动完整恢复其先前状态。"

#: includes/class-branch-service.php:398
msgid "The branch could not be updated. Its previous state was restored."
msgstr "无法更新分支，已恢复到更新前的状态。"

#: includes/class-branch-service.php:455
msgid ""
"The branch baseline could not be updated. Its previous state was restored."
msgstr "无法更新分支基准信息。已恢复之前的状态。"

#: includes/class-branch-service.php:542 includes/class-branch-service.php:576
msgid "The branch baseline snapshot could not be stored."
msgstr "无法保存分支基准快照。"

#: includes/class-merge-service.php:82
msgid "You do not have permission to force this merge."
msgstr "你没有权限强制执行此次合并。"

#: includes/class-merge-service.php:161
msgid "The branch or original could not be snapshotted before merging."
msgstr "合并前无法为分支或原始文章创建快照。"

#: includes/class-merge-service.php:185 includes/class-rest-controller.php:236
msgid "The review state changed. Review the latest changes before merging."
msgstr "审阅状态已发生变化。合并前请重新检查最新更改。"

#: includes/class-merge-service.php:200
msgid ""
"The merge failed and the original could not be fully restored automatically."
msgstr "合并失败，并且无法自动完整恢复原始文章。"

#: includes/class-merge-service.php:210
msgid ""
"The merge could not be completed. The original post was restored to its pre-"
"merge state."
msgstr "无法完成合并，原始文章已恢复到合并前的状态。"

#: includes/class-merge-service.php:225
msgid ""
"The merge was applied, the branch could not be moved to Trash, and the "
"original could not be fully restored automatically."
msgstr "合并已应用，但无法将分支移至回收站，并且无法自动完整恢复原始文章。"

#: includes/class-merge-service.php:235
msgid ""
"The branch could not be moved to Trash, so the original post was restored "
"and the branch remains active."
msgstr "无法将分支移至回收站，因此已恢复原始文章，分支仍保持有效。"

#: includes/class-merge-service.php:264
msgid "This post is not a branch."
msgstr "这篇文章不是分支。"

#: includes/class-merge-service.php:268
msgid "You do not have permission to discard this branch."
msgstr "你没有权限放弃这个分支。"

#: includes/class-merge-service.php:273
msgid "The branch could not be moved to Trash."
msgstr "无法将该分支移到回收站。"

#: includes/class-merge-service.php:297
msgid "The branch relationship changed before the merge could be applied."
msgstr "应用合并前，分支关联关系发生了变化。"

#: includes/class-merge-service.php:302
msgid "The original post no longer exists."
msgstr "原始文章已不存在。"

#: includes/class-merge-service.php:305
msgid "The branch and original no longer use the same post type."
msgstr "分支与原始文章已不再使用相同的文章类型。"

#: includes/class-merge-service.php:308
msgid "You do not have permission to merge this branch."
msgstr "你没有权限合并这个分支。"

#: includes/class-merge-service.php:328
msgid ""
"This older branch has no three-way baseline. Review the original before "
