msgid "%1$d branch changes · %2$d conflicts"
msgstr "%1$d 项分支更改 · %2$d 项冲突"

#: build/index.js:7 src/index.js:529
msgid ""
"Edit safely in a separate draft. The published post stays unchanged until "
"you merge the branch."
msgstr "可在独立草稿中安全编辑；在合并分支之前，已发布的文章不会发生变化。"

#: build/index.js:7 src/index.js:538
msgid ""
"This original has unsaved editor changes. Save or discard them before "
"creating a branch so the baseline matches the saved public post."
msgstr ""
"原始文章存在未保存的编辑。创建分支前请保存或放弃这些更改，使基准与已保存的公"
"开文章一致。"

#: build/index.js:7 src/index.js:552
msgid "Creating…"
msgstr "正在创建…"

#: build/index.js:7 src/index.js:620
msgid "Merge review"
msgstr "合并检查"

#: build/index.js:7 src/index.js:626
msgid ""
"This branch predates three-way snapshots, so detailed change comparison is "
"unavailable. Force merge only after manually reviewing the original."
msgstr ""
"此分支创建于三方快照功能之前，因此无法提供详细更改比较。请手动检查原始文章后"
"再强制合并。"

#: build/index.js:7 src/index.js:632
msgid "Branch changes"
msgstr "分支更改"

#: build/index.js:7 src/index.js:636
msgid "Original changes since branch creation"
msgstr "创建分支后原始文章的更改"

#: build/index.js:7 src/index.js:648
msgid "Original identity changes preserved by merge"
msgstr "合并时保留的原始文章标识更改"

#: build/index.js:7 src/index.js:666
msgid "Resolve each conflicting field"
msgstr "逐个解决冲突字段"

#: build/index.js:7 src/index.js:674
msgid "Other non-conflicting edits remain preserved. Inspect the values above."
msgstr "其他没有冲突的更改将予以保留。请检查上方各项值。"

#: build/index.js:7 src/index.js:710
msgid "Choose"
msgstr "请选择"

#: build/index.js:7 build/index.js:9 src/index.js:743 src/index.js:1350
msgid "Merge selected values"
msgstr "按所选值合并"

#: build/index.js:7 src/index.js:773 src/index.js:796
msgid "Saving and merging…"
msgstr "正在保存并合并…"

#: build/index.js:7 src/index.js:777
msgid "Save & merge into original"
msgstr "保存并合并到原始文章"

#: build/index.js:7 src/index.js:800
msgid "Force merge reviewed conflicts"
msgstr "强制合并已检查的冲突"

#: build/index.js:7 src/index.js:813
msgid ""
"The original has newer, non-conflicting changes. You can update this branch "
"first, or review and merge while preserving those original changes."
msgstr ""
"原始文章有较新的非冲突更改。你可以先用原始文章更新分支，也可以检查后直接合并"
"并保留这些原始更改。"

#: build/index.js:7 src/index.js:822
msgid ""
"The original identity changed (for example status, slug, author, or parent). "
"Those changes are preserved and are not overwritten by this branch."
msgstr ""
"原始文章的标识信息发生了变化（例如状态、别名、作者或父级）。这些更改会被保"
"留，不会被此分支覆盖。"

#: build/index.js:7 src/index.js:831
msgid ""
"The branch and original changed the same data differently. Review the "
"conflicts before deciding whether to force merge."
msgstr ""
"分支和原始文章对同一数据做了不同修改。请先检查冲突，再决定是否强制合并。"

#: build/index.js:7 src/index.js:840
msgid ""
"This older branch cannot provide a precise three-way comparison. Review the "
"original manually before forcing a merge."
msgstr "这个旧版分支无法提供精确的三方比较。强制合并前请手动检查原始文章。"

#: build/index.js:7 src/index.js:862
msgid "This draft is isolated from the public original."
msgstr "此草稿与公开的原始文章相互独立。"

#: build/index.js:7 src/index.js:874
msgid "Open original"
msgstr "打开原始文章"

#. translators: %d: number of synced patterns referenced by the branch.
#: build/index.js:9 src/index.js:899
msgid ""
"This branch references %d synced pattern(s). Editing a synced pattern is "
"global in WordPress and is not isolated by the branch."
msgstr ""
"此分支引用了 %d 个同步区块样板。编辑同步样板会全局影响 WordPress，并不会被分"
"支隔离。"

#: build/index.js:9 src/index.js:918
msgid "Preview branch"
msgstr "预览分支"

#: build/index.js:9 src/index.js:928
msgid "View original"
msgstr "查看原始文章"

#: build/index.js:9 src/index.js:951 src/index.js:1282 src/index.js:1334
msgid "Cancel"
msgstr "取消"

#: build/index.js:9 src/index.js:1213
msgid "Updating…"
msgstr "正在更新…"

#: build/index.js:9 src/index.js:1214
msgid "Update branch from original"
msgstr "从原始文章更新分支"

#: build/index.js:9 src/index.js:1230
msgid "Hide merge review"
msgstr "隐藏合并检查"

#: build/index.js:9 src/index.js:1242
msgid "Discard branch"
msgstr "放弃分支"

#: build/index.js:9 src/index.js:1256
msgid "Force merge conflicts?"
msgstr "强制合并冲突吗？"

#: build/index.js:9 src/index.js:1257
msgid "Discard this branch?"
msgstr "放弃这个分支吗？"

#: build/index.js:9 src/index.js:1264
msgid ""
"Force merge will prefer branch values for the listed conflicts. Non-"
"conflicting newer work on the original is still preserved."
msgstr ""
"强制合并会对列出的冲突优先采用分支值；原始文章中不冲突的较新更改仍会保留。"

#: build/index.js:9 src/index.js:1268
msgid ""
"The branch will be moved to Trash. The public original will not be changed."
msgstr "分支将被移到回收站，公开的原始文章不会发生变化。"

#: build/index.js:9 src/index.js:1300
msgid "Force merge"
msgstr "强制合并"

#: build/index.js:9 src/index.js:1301
msgid "Move to Trash"
msgstr "移到回收站"

#: build/index.js:9 src/index.js:1311
msgid "Confirm selected conflict values"
msgstr "确认所选冲突字段值"

#: build/index.js:9 src/index.js:1320
msgid ""
"The selected values will replace those conflicts. Other independent edits "
"remain preserved."
msgstr "将使用所选值解决对应冲突，其他独立更改会保留。"
